{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1741","id":4148341574,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p873QqtG","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1741","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1741.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1741.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1741","number":1741,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Reconcile complete cumulative Paper 3 semantic KG","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- reconcile the complete cumulative Paper 3 semantic authority across all nine live Topic scopes\n- publish terminal dispositions for all 742 structural P3 Questions and 1,893 QuestionParts, including 26 explicitly unenriched Questions and 204 previously uncovered score-owning parts\n- resolve exactly 60 emitted, exact-evidence cross-family supporting ProcedureInstances from candidate to approved while leaving candidate QuestionType/classification decisions fail-closed\n- preserve all prior approved semantic objects except the explicit status-only transitions recorded in the final reconciliation ledger\n- publish the active cumulative registry, shared procedure library, deterministic KG projection, authenticated product readback, compact reconciliation ledger, and rollback pointer to #1730\n- bind runtime/API custody to the final #1731 manifest and expose approved supporting composition without fabricating a primary classification\n\n## User impact and root cause\n\nThe predecessor release contained all nine produced Topic shards, but it was not yet a complete Paper-level authority. Twenty-six structurally verified P3 Questions were absent from the semantic registry, 204 score-owning parts lacked an explicit terminal ledger disposition, and 60 exact-evidence supporting applications remained candidate-only after their owning ProcedureModels had become active. Runtime custody was also pinned to the predecessor release.\n\nThis change closes those gaps without generating new corpus semantics. It derives terminal coverage from the structural authority and immutable child decisions, records genuine gaps as `unenriched`, promotes only the 60 already-emitted supporting instances that pass exact QP/MS, active-model, supporting-role, and ownership-conflict checks, and keeps all candidate classifications—including the eight unmodeled Numerical Solution context candidates—isolated.\n\n## Final metrics\n\n- Paper 3 Questions: 742 / 742 terminal dispositions\n- Paper 3 QuestionParts: 1,893 / 1,893 terminal dispositions\n- score-owning QuestionParts: 1,413\n- instruction-only QuestionParts: 480\n- previously uncovered score-owning parts explicitly reconciled: 204\n- explicitly unenriched Questions: 26\n- approved / candidate / abstain / rejected P3 Questions: 688 / 23 / 1 / 4\n- cumulative semantic registry records: 955\n- supporting ProcedureInstance promotions: 60\n- per-family remaining candidate ProcedureInstances: 0\n- remaining candidate ProcedureInstances: 0\n- candidate classification promotions: 0\n- active ProcedureInstances: 1,149, of which 1,147 approved and 2 rejected\n- active QuestionTypes / ProcedureModels: 56 / 52\n- approved-object product readback: 100%\n\n## Release custody\n\n- starting main commit: `9474b322433590329d7fd8bc187cffbd7f02abc4`\n- starting main tree: `3b5d0d3f6eafc2cc43f5618f7c36f3c7c16204ec`\n- active manifest SHA256: `e7470901b8ebb87100fed0542ca3c07800b1359fc23d87f28b0a564a9633b2b1`\n- active nodes SHA256: `1f4ecdad194f46706a5800d9b5301338b3f2f0f9dab3168d82f2fcd8dce56f9f`\n- active edges SHA256: `10db3e427de7898e178399a7ed5ec798075993eb414e62346c5551f3ce5cf453`\n- rollback manifest SHA256: `8ddb1063c9edba4610eb6417e6b414d6c0f3397196f801e10c5c45ff2e4f5f5b`\n\n## Validation\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1731_paper3_final_reconciliation.test.py` — 8/8 PASS\n- combined KG service, API, and real gateway Jest suites — 3 suites, 70/70 PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1731_paper3_final_reconciliation.py --check` — byte-identical replay PASS\n- raw-byte manifest/nodes/edges custody and exact metric/readback probes — PASS\n- pinned-root ESLint for all three changed JavaScript files — PASS\n- Python compilation for the finalizer and focused suite — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- `npm run quality:report-index` — PASS, zero violations\n- final AO preflight — workflow/artifact/A+ guards healthy; expected feature-branch and dirty-state warnings only before commit\n\nAll hard integrity counters are zero, deterministic rebuild is PASS, and no provider call, remote write, structural-authority write, safe-rejection input, screenshot, RAG, or new database was used.\n\nCloses #1731\n","created_at":"2026-07-28T04:49:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T05:24:58Z","closed_at":"2026-07-28T05:18:22Z","merged_at":"2026-07-28T05:18:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"829365fb03a60f2965180cbfa4a5aaf164fef0a2","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"comm